1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,170
She signed as a trainee at around eleven years old.

2
00:00:03,170 --> 00:00:10,631
What followed were five years of the Y-G system — the same assembly line that forged 2NE1 and BLACKPINK.

3
00:00:10,631 --> 00:00:14,716
Vocal reps. Rap reps. Dance until the mirrors fog.

4
00:00:14,716 --> 00:00:19,948
Monthly evaluations where one bad performance can freeze your file for a year.

5
00:00:19,948 --> 00:00:21,662
Most trainees wash out.

6
00:00:21,662 --> 00:00:23,659
The system is designed that way.

